JSP API 2.1 schema and DTD resources
===================================

The standard JSP resources below are bundled without changes in
lib/jsp-api-2.1.jar (javax/servlet/jsp/resources/) in Hadoop 2 and in
lib/hadoop-client-runtime-3.4.3.jar
(org/apache/hadoop/shaded/javax/servlet/jsp/resources/) in Hadoop 3.

Sun subsequently published these resources in GlassFish under the
CDDL/GPL choice reproduced below. Amoro selects CDDL-1.1 for these
resources; the complete terms are in LICENSE.CDDL-1.1 in this directory.
The original headers in the dependency JARs are retained.

The original source form is included in the JARs at the paths above.
The following upstream files provide the CDDL notices for the same
JSP schema/DTD definitions. The earlier resources differ in licensing
comments, formatting, version annotations and an unused namespace.

